        {
          "id": "separate-and-release",
          "label": "Separate the parties and release the scene",
          "text": "Sometimes the best result is to separate the participants, restore passage, and release them without unnecessary punishment while keeping a minimal record in case the problem repeats. That is practical resolution, not a virtue score.",
