        },
        {
          "id": "enforce-clear-route",
          "label": "Enforce the clear-route requirement",
          "text": "When a passage is genuinely blocked, the Guard can require it to be cleared, but the record should describe the specific obstruction rather than poverty as an offense. Housing status and the duty problem remain different facts.",
          "conditions": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "addCareerFact",
